  - timestamp: 2026-04-27 13:09:29
    panelType: Vehicle Customization
    userPrompt: More stability
    explanation: 'Increased stability by: enabling angularDragHelper (0.3) to prevent
      spinning, boosting helper strengths (steerHelper 0.35, tractionHelper 0.5),
      doubling antiroll forces for less body roll, adding downForce (80) for speed-dependent
      grip, lowering COM (-0.15m) for better balance, and stiffening sideways friction
      (extremum 1.1, asymptote 0.85, stiffness 1.2) for better cornering control.
      Vehicle will feel planted and confident.'
    appliedJson: "{\n  \"stability\": {\n    \"ABS\": true,\n    \"ESP\": true,\n   
      \"TCS\": true,\n    \"steeringHelper\": true,\n    \"steerHelperStrength\":
